\n","\n","1) **Types:** `year` is a whole number, so it contains no placeholder.\n","\n","2) **Order:** the rows do not start at 1950. The first rows run backwards from 2009 (2009, 2008, 2007, ...), so the order of rows in the file is not the order of time. Anything that depends on \"earlier races\", such as form features, must be sorted by year or date explicitly, never by the order rows happen to be stored in.\n","\n","3) **Usefulness:** the table holds nothing beyond the list of years, since `url` is not needed. The year of each race is also stored in `races`, so this table matters mainly as a check that both agree, which we do when we open `races`.\n","\n","4) **Available before the race?** Yes. The season a race belongs to is known in advance."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"2eb5acd7","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.020911,"end_time":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.714681+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.69377+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 1.1.5 **status**"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":10,"id":"6e34d5af","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.760476Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.759977Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.776295Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.774793Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.040875,"end_time":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.778293+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-19T18:59:17.737418+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["<class 'pandas.core.frame.DataFrame'>\n","RangeIndex: 139 entries, 0 to 138\n","Data columns (total 2 columns):\n"," #   Column    Non-Null Count  Dtype \n","---  ------    --------------  ----- \n"," 0   statusId  139 non-null    int64 \n"," 1   status    139 non-null    object\n","dtypes: int64(1), object(1)\n","memory usage: 2.3+ KB\n"]},{"data":{"text/html":["<div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        v